Interpretation
------------------------------------------------------------------------
standard_source is exact but still too close to the raw observer-marked
  quotient.  Its good classes are pure because observer-source is visible.
binary_danger_lex forces all blockers above all safe runners.  It usually
  collapses many unsafe states while preserving pure good target classes.
ternary_danger_lex keeps near-safe versus deep-safe information; it trades
  compression for a more geometric source neighborhood.
two_sentinel_safe_arc makes the target a two-marked safe-arc class problem.
safe_only_subtournament is the harshest quotient: LRC is exhibition of
  the top safe-count layer.  It is pure by construction but loses blockers.
crt_channel is the arithmetic quotient.  It can be tiny, but its coarse
  channel memory needs coupled debt labels to become a proof tool.
